{"description": "Pizza slice pair (two wedge-cut pieces of a rectangular/square pizza) on the lower right of the plate: golden-orange tomato sauce visible through melted, slightly browned cheese with some bubbling and charred spots on the crust edge; cheese has a glossy sheen, crust is thick, pale, and browned underneath. Covers roughly 20-25% of the plate footprint, about 2-3 cm thick.", "candidates": ["Sicilian/square pizza slice with cheese", "Thin-crust cheese pizza slice", "Focaccia pizza with tomato and mozzarella"], "grams": 220},
{"description": "Grilled or sautéed meat pieces (two to three chunks) at the upper right: greyish-brown surfaces with pinkish-gray interior visible in cut, slightly moist, with flecks of green herbs/parsley and some browned edges. Pieces are about 2-3 cm and 1-1.5 cm thick, covering roughly 8% of the plate.", "Sliced pork tenderloin or pork loin with herbs", "Beef steak tips or sirloin pieces", "Chicken thigh pieces (dark meat)"], "grams": 110},
{"description": "Stuffed pasta or roll-like item (cylindrical, golden-tan crust with a seam, some browned and crisp edges, a lighter filling showing at cut end) next to the meat, with bits of green herb and orange sauce spots nearby. Covers about 5% of plate, roughly 3 cm thick.", "Stuffed cannoli-style pastry or pastry roll", "Baked pasta roll (manicotti or cannelloni)", "Fried stuffed pastry such as a bread roll with filling"], "grams": 80},
{"description": "Scattered orange-red sauce smears and small blobs on the plate near the meat and roll, glossy and thin, with a few crumbs; small amount, low height.", "candidates": ["Tomato sauce", "Marinara with oil", "Pizza sauce"], "grams": 15}
]}
